<title>USA: Martin Lawrence says court okays plan.</title>
<headline>Martin Lawrence says court okays plan.</headline>
<dateline>VAN NUYS, Calif. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Martin Lawrence Limited Editions Inc on Friday said its plan of reorganization was confirmed by the U.S. Bankruptcy Court earlier in the week and effective today. The company is now a privately held unit of Chalk &amp; Vermilion LLC.</p>
</text>
